        "reason": "Viewer/downward head and bill attention is readable at normal scale. Broad body extent and stationary stance remain coherent; small toe/feather redraw and a slight lower-foot variation remain visible but do not dominate the action. This is a qualified source-art judgment, not sole/contact acceptance."
