    "semanticLookGainRecommended": 1,
    "normalSizeEvidence": "Actual120CSS full stage, density1, raw and common-crop codec on light/dark. Own live neutral60\u2192pose18\u2192neutral12@30Hz verifies60\u201377 attention, exact78 neutral return and89 terminal through3000ms without page errors. Shared transparent margin crop is drawn at the original full-stage origin; visible bird scale is preserved. Minor stance-detail redraw is judged visually rather than by an automatic RGBA equality or alpha-probe gate.",
